src/web/
tests/Llm.Tests/
tests/deploy/

**/bin/
**/obj/
native/
**/node_modules/
src/argus-web/dist/
src/argus-web/test-results/
src/argus-web/playwright-report/
src/argus-web/e2e/.work/
TestResults/

data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
